<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>상황별 코디 추천</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>👗 오늘 뭐 입지? 👔</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">상황을 선택하고 옷 추천 버튼을 눌러보세요!</p>

        <div class="input-group">
            <label for="situation-select">어떤 상황인가요?</label>
            <select id="situation-select">
                <option value="company">🏢 출근 / 회사</option>
                <option value="date">❤️ 데이트</option>
                <option value="exercise">🏃‍♂️ 운동 / 헬스</option>
                <option value="rest">🛋️ 집에서 휴식</option>
                <option value="party">🎉 파티 / 경사</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <button id="recommend-btn">옷 추천 받기</button>

        <div id="result-card" class="result-card hidden">
            <div id="emoji-display" class="emoji-display"></div>
            <h2 id="outfit-title"></h2>
            <p id="outfit-desc"></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>